Huenison has been updated a little bit - this new version:
* excludes from the options the resolutions bigger than the desktop's (the OS might report wrong resolutions, for example due to a KVM switch);
* replaces the star icon with a thumbs-up icon to mark the best resolutions;
* includes slightly revised documentation;
* includes a few other minor internal improvements.

Have fun!

